# --- Points-prediction model: kept private for now -----------------------------------------
# The modelling code and its outputs are deliberately not published yet. They still exist and
# run locally; they are simply untracked. NOTE this does not erase them from history — they were
# public in commit 4bb3699 and remain visible there. Removing them from the current tree only
# stops further exposure.
#
# Consequence: with 05_ untracked there is nothing for a CI job to run, so predict-points.yml is
# untracked too and predictions are generated locally when wanted.
